      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>\u1e2aayber</em>:\u00a0It is one of the cities of the\u00a0\u1e24ic\u0101z (Hijaz). It is a town abundant in dates. In the language of the Jewish people,\u00a0<em>\u1e2bayber</em>\u00a0means\u00a0<em>\u1e25\u0131\u1e63n</em> (fortress). [translation]</p>",
